#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/colombia.rst:40
msgid "**Automatic tax calculation and reporting**: Odoo automates tax calculations for VAT (IVA) and other applicable taxes, ensuring accuracy and compliance with DIAN's tax reporting standards."
