msgid "**Automatic VAT calculation and reporting**: Odoo Invoicing ensures full compliance with Luxembourg's VAT regulations by automating VAT calculations and formatting invoices to meet the legal standards for :abbr:`B2G (business-to-government)` and B2B transactions."
