#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:191
msgid ":guilabel:`Retention`: advance payment of a tax that is applied on payments."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Retention`: az adó előlegfizetése, amelyet a kifizetésekre alkalmaznak."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:194
msgid "Special taxes"
