msgid "Taxes' ATC codes are used for the :ref:`BIR 2307 <localizations/philippines/report-BIR1207>`, :ref:`SAWT and QAP reports <localizations/philippines/report-QAP-SAWT>`. If a tax is created manually, its ATC code must be added."
