msgid "Leyenda and additional information"
msgstr "Legenda és kiegészítő információ"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uruguay.rst:377
msgid "To add a *leyenda* or additional information to the electronic invoice and XML, access the invoice, go to the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab, and select the desired addenda in the :guilabel:`Addenda and Disclosure` field. The addenda and disclosures added here will appear in the XML and visibly in the PDF document."
